    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – My New Year Wishes",
      "",
      "Yet again it’s a new year.",
      "",
      "I have a lot of hopes for the new year, and these are my three biggest wishes.",
      "",
      "First, I wish for my mom and dad to live happily, and not miss me too much;",
      "",
      "Second, I want my Chinese to improve, and that I can pass HSK level 3 this year;",
      "",
      "Third, I want to find a girlfriend. My good friend Lili got a boyfriend. I also want to find someone.",
      ""
